                "text": "While Republicans increase health care costs, I\u2019m working with @DemWomenCaucus, @HouseDemocrats, and advocates on solutions to ensure women and families in the #FightingFifth and across the country can afford their child care & health care. https://t.co/3npCSCSeOA",
