                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined the Steering and Policy Committee and @DemWomenCaucus hearing to support America\u2019s caregivers and protect the health care of millions of women and families. It was my honor to introduce my #FightingFifth constituent, Kingia Randall \u2014 a devoted caregiver to her family. Thank you to all the panelists and organizations who spoke out against this Republican health care crisis.",
