                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "My Republican colleagues have been on vacation for a month and a half while Mike Johnson refuses to call the House into session. As this #RepublicanShutdown drags on, families are missing SNAP benefits and watching their health care costs rise. I\u2019m working for the people of the #FightingFifth to ensure every family can afford the care they need.",
