                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The #RepublicanShutdown is ripping plates from tables. I\u2019ve been out in the #FightingFifth delivering groceries to seniors, but that\u2019s a drop in the bucket compared to our communities\u2019 needs. We must reopen the government, lower health care costs, and keep children, seniors, veterans, and working families fed. It\u2019s a false choice to do anything less.",
