                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans are forcing us to choose between keeping healthcare costs low, feeding hungry children, and paying our dedicated federal workers.\n\nFor me, it\u2019s a false choice. It\u2019s a NO on any bill that does not address the Republican health care crisis.",
