                "text": "The #RepublicanShutdown \u2014 the longest government shutdown in history \u2014 ended this week with no promise of affordable health care in sight. You can bet I will keep fighting to save our health care. Catch up on the rest of my week with #NikemasNotes! https://t.co/BYfC4O4X06",
