                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This year, I fought back\u2014and continue to fight\u2014against the Trump Administration\u2019s assault on our public health. From standing with laid-off CDC employees to holding RFK Jr. and HHS accountable, I will never stop fighting for your health and safety. https://t.co/Dy3u8sfR9Q",
